{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260ciMbvRpDI1795412740.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產山村道分行副區域營業經理石修文表示，分行新近促成跑馬地THE ASTER租賃成交，單位為中高層B室，實用面積617平方呎，採2房間隔，向北，望樓景。單位原以月租4.2萬元放租，最終以40,500元租出，折合實用呎租65.6元。</p><p><br/>石修文表示，新租客為外區客，心儀跑馬地地理位置便利，且居住環境清靜舒適，見單位間隔合適即決定承租。據了解，據了解，業主於2024年以1,725萬元購入單位，持貨2年，是次出租可享2.8厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:31:53.329369+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:37:17.479227+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T07:25:17.541972+00:00","content_hash":"650ca4ece2f1a4b2848daaa96f0ffc42dfc261e500f955fa1e59b48393d8b17d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:31:53.329369+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}